# Quintorius Kand's -6 on turn 9 targets Strip Mine, Lightning Bolt and a Dark Ritual in Bot1's graveyard. In response Bot2's
# Lion Sash exiles the Lightning Bolt (CR 608.2b): that target is illegal when the ability resolves, the other two are not.
# Only the cards really exiled count: Strip Mine and the Dark Ritual are exiled and may be played, {R}{R} is added (not
# three), and the Bolt is in Bot2's exile pile, not Bot1's to play (the second Dark Ritual stays in the graveyard).

